  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Since MessageHeaders are immutable, the call to this method\nwill result in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "由于 MessageHeaders 是不可变的，调用此方法将导致 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>。",
      "count": 8
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>headers</code> - a map with headers to add",
      "translation": "<code>headers</code> - 一个用于添加标题的映射。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>IMPORTANT</b>: This class is immutable. Any mutating operation such as\n<code>put(..)</code>, <code>putAll(..)</code> and others will throw\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<b>重要</b>：此类是不可变的。任何修改操作，例如<code>put(..)</code>、<code>putAll(..)</code>及其他操作，都将抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/UnsupportedOperationException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>UnsupportedOperationException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses do have access to the raw headers, however, via <a href=\"#getRawHeaders()\"><code>getRawHeaders()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "子类确实可以通过<a href=\"#getRawHeaders()\"><code>getRawHeaders()</code></a>访问原始标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "One way to create message headers is to use the\n<a href=\"support/MessageBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageBuilder</code></a>:",
      "translation": "一种创建消息标题的方法是使用 <a href=\"support/MessageBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageBuilder</code></a>：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a <a href=\"MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> with the given headers. An <a href=\"#ID\"><code>ID</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#TIMESTAMP\"><code>TIMESTAMP</code></a> headers will also be added, overriding any existing values.",
      "translation": "使用给定的标头构建一个 `<a href=\"MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>`。还会添加 `<a href=\"#ID\"><code>ID</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"#TIMESTAMP\"><code>TIMESTAMP</code></a>` 标头，并覆盖任何现有值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a <a href=\"MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> with the given headers.",
      "translation": "使用给定的标头构造一个 `<a href=\"MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The key for the Message ID. This is an automatically generated UUID and\nshould never be explicitly set in the header map <b>except</b> in the\ncase of Message deserialization where the serialized Message's generated\nUUID is being restored.",
      "translation": "消息 ID 的键。这是一个自动生成的 UUID，除非在反序列化消息时恢复已序列化的消息的生成 UUID，否则绝不应在标头映射中显式设置<b>（除上述情况外）</b>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The key for the message content type.",
      "translation": "消息内容类型的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The key for the message error channel.",
      "translation": "消息错误通道的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "UUID for none.",
      "translation": "无的 UUID。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The key for the message reply channel.",
      "translation": "消息回复通道的密钥。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The key for the message timestamp.",
      "translation": "消息时间戳的键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructor providing control over the ID and TIMESTAMP header values.",
      "translation": "提供对 ID 和 TIMESTAMP 标头值进行控制的构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
